APNI ABA BICHA KAR TUKDE UTHA RAHE HAIN,<br>
 DULHA KI LAASH SARWAR MAQTAL SE LA RAHE HAIN<br>
<br>
HAR GAAM SONCHTE HAIN FARWA KO KYA BATAO,<br>
 PAMALIYE BADAN KI RUDAD KYA SUNAO,<br>
 KIS TARHA LAASHE QASIM KHAIME MEIN LEKE JAYO,<br>
 HAR EK QADAM PA RUKH KAR AANSU BAHA RAHE HAIN<br>
<br>
RAAHE KHUDA MEIN QASIM JAAN APNI NAZAR KARNE,<br>
 PAANE KO IZNE SHEH SE THE MUZTARIB KUCH AISE,<br>
 KHUSH HOGAYE WASIYAT BABA KI MAA SE SUNKE,<br>
 TAWEEZ APNI LAKAR SHEH KO BATA RAHE HAIN<br>
<br>
 SEHRAYE KARBALA MEIN SHAADI RACHI YE KAISI,<br>
 HAIN TEEN DEEN KE PYASE JISME SABHI BARATI,<br>
 SHADI KE GHAR MEIN HAR SU CHAYI THI EK UDASI,<br>
 BETI KO APNE SARWAR BEWA BANA RAHE HAIN<br>
<br>
 SHAADI KI JAA PA MATAM ALLAH KYA SAMA HAI,<br>
 RANJ-O-ALAM MEIN DOOBA PYASO KA KARWAN HAI, <br>
FARWA KE DIL KA YARAAB YEH KAISA IMTEHAAN HAI,<br>
 MASNAD BICHI HUI HAI DULHA KO LA RAHE HAI<br>
<br>
 SEHRE KI SAARI LADIYA RAN MEIN BIKHAR GAYI HAIN, <br>
 SHADI KI SAARI KHUSHYA JANE KIDHAR GAYI HAIN,<br>
 MANZAR LAHOO LAHOO THA NAZRE JIDHAR GAYI HAI,<br>
 NOUSHAH-E- KARBALA KA SAB GHAM MANA RAHE HAIN<br>
<br>
KUCH DER KI YEH DULHAN BAITHI HAI SAR JHUKAYE,<br>
 HUM SIN HAI KOUN JISKO AB DARD-E-DIL SUNAYE,<br>
 YEH DHOOP BEKASI KI YEH BEWAGI KE SAYE,<br>
 JAZBE UDASIYO KA TOOFAN UTHA RAHI HAIN<br>
<br>
IBNE HASAN KA LAASHA KHAIME MAIN AAYA JISDAM,<br>
 US DAM SOHAIL BARPA THA EK SHOR-E-MATAM,<br>
 AB HAAL KYA BAYAAN HO JO KARB THA ALAM,<br>
 HAR DIL PA RANJ-O-GHAM KE BADAL SE CHHA RAHE HAIN...